{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach and grab object, process its properties, move to destination, do specific task. If not found, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
